# Packaging ignore list. Replaces .gitignore for `moon package` rather than
# adding to it, so it repeats the build/vendor entries from there on top of the
# publish-only exclusions. Without the `target` entries the Rust oracle's build
# directory would be packaged.
.DS_Store
_build/
target/
target
.mooncakes/
.moonagent/

# Development tooling only: the Rust conformance oracle needs cargo and a
# network fetch of `fluent-uri`, and is of no use to a consumer. The generated
# corpus it produces ships, so `moon test` still checks this port against
# `fluent-uri` from the published package alone.
tools/
AGENTS.md
